00:31:51.570 --> 00:31:53.130
that they are wearing the same outfit.
她们撞衫了。

771
00:31:53.770 --> 00:31:57.170
Before we dive into that scene, I needed to address something, okay?
在我们深入探讨那个场景之前，我需要说明一件事，好吗？

